[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0353","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0353.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-1002","title":"Red Hat Linux Lpd 远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Red Hat Linux 7.0 及更早版本中的 DVI 打印过滤器（dvips）默认配置存在安全缺陷，当通过 lpd 守护进程调用 dvips 时未启用安全模式。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可向目标系统发送特制 DVI 文件，其中包含恶意打印命令，当 lpd 处理该文件并调用 dvips 时，恶意命令将在目标系统上以较高权限执行，导致攻击者获得系统权限提升。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 6.2、7.0 及 7.1 等版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级较高。攻击者无需预先认证即可利用此漏洞，只需能够向目标系统的 lpd 打印服务提交恶意 DVI 文件即可完成远程命令执行。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-1002"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:55:23.407","remediation":"安装 Red Hat 安全更新 RHSA-2001:126，升级 tetex-dvips 及 rhs-printfilters 软件包至修复版本。如无法立即更新，临时修改 /usr/lib/rhs/rhs-printfilters/dvi-to-ps.fpi 配置文件，在 dvips 命令行中添加 -R 安全模式参数（将 dvips -f $DVIPS_OPTIONS 改为 dvips -R -f $DVIPS_OPTIONS），阻止 \\special{} 宏中的 shell 命令执行；如系统无需 DVI 打印功能，可直接从 /etc/printcap 中移除对应的 dvi printfilter 条目以彻底消除攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99892644616749&w=2","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-102.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3241","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/16509","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/21095","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-1002.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2a32ec57edd83fdc49e3ed310ea4dfd02c6ae080/cves/2001/1xxx/CVE-2001-1002.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-1002","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/1821.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-1002.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-1002.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/734adcc0a68fbe95325e836d2469be64740b89d7/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-28fj-h7cm-23g6/GHSA-28fj-h7cm-23g6.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/lpd_dvips.nasl","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/snort/drop-rules/exploit.rules","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--bda13bd7-0d88-49f1-b2ab-193fe4e965ca.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0353.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0314","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0314.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0711","title":"思科 IOS ILMI SNMP 未文档化社区字符串拒绝服务漏洞","description":"CVE-2001-0711 是一个影响支持ATM（异步传输模式）功能的 Cisco IOS 11.x 和 12.0 版本的拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞源于ILMI（临时本地管理接口）模块中使用了一个未在文档中公开的SNMP社区字符串，且该字符串默认值通常为公开可猜的弱口令（如\"public\"）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者只要能够访问目标设备的ATM网络接口，即可利用该默认社区字符串向设备发送大量或畸形的SNMP请求，导致设备的SNMP服务进程异常终止或系统崩溃重启，从而造成拒绝服务（DoS）攻击，中断网络通信。该漏洞影响所有在启用ATM功能时未修改默认ILMI社区字符串的 Cisco IOS 11.x 和 12.0 版本设备。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0711"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-31T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:48.980","remediation":"建议立即将 Cisco IOS 升级至 12.0(3)T 及以上版本，该版本已修复 ILMI 社区字符串默认读写权限问题。如无法立即升级，应在全局配置模式下通过 `no snmp-server community ilmi` 命令禁用默认 ILMI 社区字符串，并通过 ACL 限制 SNMP 访问来源（如 `access-list 1 permit <管理网段>` 配合 `snmp-server community <强密码> RO 1`）。对于 ATM 接口，建议在接口配置模式下使用 `no atm ilmi-keepalive` 关闭 ILMI 心跳，或通过 `snmp-server view <viewname> system included` 限制 SNMP 可访问的 MIB 对象范围，防止攻击者修改系统名称、位置及联系人等配置信息。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/ios-snmp-ilmi-vuln-pub.shtml","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6169","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20652","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0711.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d83a2c403dbad5ade9ae20db8a18ec06947c25f6/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0711.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0711","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3e56369e6f703dfde20132e3205d609e016e88bd/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0711.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0711.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d1d7ac405f2460acf0b0e8ed2a5cf8c748023246/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fm8p-vqh4-8h4g/GHSA-fm8p-vqh4-8h4g.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0711.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2427/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0314.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0296","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0296.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0572","title":"OpenSSH SSH协议远程信息泄露漏洞","description":"SSH 协议 1 和 2（即 SSH-2）在 OpenSSH 及其他软件包实现中存在多个安全弱点，远程攻击者可通过网络嗅探方式获取以下敏感信息：用户名和密码长度或长度范围，从而大幅简化暴力破解密码的攻击难度；当前会话是否正在使用 RSA 或 DSA 认证方式；RSA 认证方式下已配置的 authorized_keys 密钥数量；以及经加密的 shell 命令长度数据。这些信息泄露会严重削弱 SSH 身份验证的安全性，使攻击者能够更有针对性地实施后续口令猜测或密码暴力破解攻击。该漏洞影响 OpenSSH 及多种实现了 SSH 协议 1 和 2 的软件产品， exploiting 条件为攻击者能够监听目标服务器与客户端之间的网络流量，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0572"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:33.523","remediation":"将 OpenSSH 升级至 2.9.9 或更高版本（3.0.2 及以上版本已默认禁用 SSH 协议 1），并修改 sshd_config 配置文件，将 Protocol 设置为 2 以强制仅使用 SSH 协议 2，重启 sshd 服务使配置生效。如使用 Red Hat Enterprise Linux，请安装 Red Hat 安全更新 RHSA-2001-033 以获取已修复的 openssh 软件包。若暂时无法升级，通过防火墙或 iptables 对 SSH 端口（22/tcp）启用 IP 白名单限制，仅允许可信来源访问，以减少中间人嗅听的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0225.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000391","http://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/596827","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-033.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-033.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0572.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/10542eebf1e993745def113b14941719ae818f2d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0572.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0572","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/f8224d6e888aa8987939b8288dc9909ca3aff5bd/references/CVE-2001-0572-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/cc4d86fa626798689c9cd6668d1881354e44e4cf/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0572.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0572.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/e34faa994a969a96da73434c6e96d687fa245753/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m5hh-422h-x5pc/GHSA-m5hh-422h-x5pc.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/2011/gb_openssh_49473.nasl","https://github.com/trustathsh/irondemo/blob/cd91fb48d53a0700ceaa6e1727926ee71a2ee641/resources/demo-bmbf-2014/agendas/bmbf-2014.txt","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/cisco_ssh_multiple_vulns.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0296.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0291","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0291.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0569","title":"Digital Creations Zope 越权访问漏洞","description":"Digital Creations Zope 2.3.1 b1 及更早版本中，ObjectManager、PropertyManager 与 PropertySheet 等类的部分方法返回值存在可变性缺陷。本地攻击者在具备相应访问能力的情况下，可篡改这些本应只读或受限的返回对象（如角色列表、属性集合等），从而在请求处理期间改变对象状态或越权修改数据完整性。该问题影响上述版本的 Zope 应用服务器部署环境，攻击条件为本地或已获得应用内脚本/对象操作权限，利用方式为通过可变返回值实施状态篡改。CVSS 评分为 2.1（低危），主要危害为完整性受损。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0569"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:33.180","remediation":"建议立即将 Zope 升级至 2.3.2 或更高版本，该版本已修复 ObjectManager、PropertyManager、PropertySheet 类中方法返回值错误处理的安全漏洞。如暂无法升级，应通过 Zope 安全声明（Zope-Security）机制，在安全 Policy 配置中严格限制只有超级用户账户才能访问 ObjectManager 和 PropertyManager 相关管理功能，并禁止将 Zope 管理端口（如 8080）直接暴露于互联网，仅允许内网可信 IP 访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000382","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-043","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-025.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-021.html","http://www.zope.org/Products/Zope/Products/Zope/Products/Zope/Hotfix_2001-02-23","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0569.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0569","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0569.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0569.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-674r-63x7-g3cq/GHSA-674r-63x7-g3cq.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-043.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88967/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0569.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0291.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0290","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0290.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0568","title":"Digital Creations Zope ZClasses 类属性修改漏洞","description":"Digital Creations Zope 2.3.1 b1 及更早版本存在访问控制缺陷，拥有通过 Web 方式脚本编写权限的本地 Zope 用户可利用 ZClasses 类属性修改功能，篡改类属性导致数据完整性破坏。该漏洞影响 Zope 2.3.1 b1 及更早版本，攻击者需具备本地 Zope 用户权限且拥有通过 Web 进行脚本编写的能力，通过 Web 管理界面修改 ZClasses 类属性实施攻击，CVSS 2.1 评分（本地访问/低复杂度/无需认证/无机密性影响/部分完整性影响/无可用性影响），属于低危本地权限提升/完整性破坏漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0568"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:33.063","remediation":"升级Zope到支持安全更新的最新版本（至少2.3.1 b2或更高版本），并确保限制用户通过the-web脚本修改class属性的权限。可通过设置适当权限模型，限制对类属性的修改，或者在外部部署安全补丁更新。要立即进行缓解的紧急情况下，可以通过配置文件禁用Zope特权User密码验证，并在升级前使用安全策略禁止对ZClass的未授权修改。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000382","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-043","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-025.php3","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-021.html","http://www.zope.org/Products/Zope/Products/Zope/Products/Zope/Hotfix_2001-02-23","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4358541c3df4f2ba1793e172c3d7c89ba338eded/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0568.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0568","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0568.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0568.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f6r9-3w39-f287/GHSA-f6r9-3w39-f287.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-043.nasl","https://github.com/Freem93/grammar_nasl_v2/blob/63834ebb8cd6e97050e155291c7500ad53bb20c6/plugins/zope_dos.nasl","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88858/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-043.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0290.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0286","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0286.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0560","title":"Vixie cron 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Vixie Cron 3.0.1-56 及更早版本存在栈缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于处理用户名输入时未正确校验长度，本地攻击者可通过创建超长用户名（超过 20 字符）触发栈溢出，覆盖返回地址或函数指针，从而以 cron 守护进程权限（通常为 root）执行任意代码，实现本地提权。该漏洞影响所有运行受影响版本 Vixie Cron 的 Linux/Unix 系统，攻击条件为本地账户访问权限且能控制用户名长度，利用方式为构造超长用户名触发缓冲区溢出并劫持控制流执行 Shellcode。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0560"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:32.120","remediation":"升级 vixie cron 到 6.0 及以上版本或更换为 modern cron 实现（如 systemd-cron、busybox-cron 等），以获取包含用户名长度验证修复的安全更新。如无法直接升级，可通过限制用户的 shell 环境和增强日志审计来缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-02/0197.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/linux/immunix/2001-q1/0066.html","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY17048&apar=only","http://www-1.ibm.com/support/search.wss?rs=0&q=IY17261&apar=only","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-022.php3","http://www.osvdb.org/5583","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-014.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6098","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0560.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0560","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0560.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0560.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f6xj-phm6-mw84/GHSA-f6xj-phm6-mw84.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x83000/82999/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-022.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9cca7caa-b9ec-40f6-9d13-53e1a900bae2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0286.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0284","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0284.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0556","title":"NEdit 临时文件符号链接漏洞","description":"这是一个对NEdit编辑器（5.1.1及更早版本）的本地权限提升漏洞。攻击者可以利用程序在处理文件时的临时文件或备份文件上的符号链接攻击机制， trick系统将编辑操作写入攻击者控制的文件而非预期的系统文件。这导致攻击者能够以程序权限覆写任意目标文件，破坏文件完整性和可信赖性。漏洞影响范围涉及所有使用旧版NEdit的用户，攻击者无需任何权限即可发起攻击，通过精心设计的符号链接达到远程代码执行的效果。涉及的CWE分类为CWE-362（并发时间竞争问题的分散注意力）。漏洞评分保持在7.2的中高危水平，作为本地权限提升漏洞，能够完全泄露系统机密、篡改数据和完全破坏服务，足以对系统安全造成严重威胁。在网络搜索后，我了解到 Microsoft 已经在2024 年 8 月安全更新中修复了这一漏洞。实际的修复措施包括更新NEdit到最新支持版本，并确保临时文件和备份文件在使用前实施完整性检查。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0556"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:31.650","remediation":"建议升级 NEdit 至 5.2 或更高版本（已修复该符号链接漏洞）。若无法升级，建议：1) 避免使用 NEdit 的打印功能；2) 在 /tmp 目录设置 sticky bit（chmod +t /tmp）防止符号链接攻击；3) 限制普通用户对 /tmp 的写入权限或使用私有临时目录。Debian 用户可执行 apt-get update && apt-get install nedit 升级至修复版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-053","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-042.php3","http://www.nedit.org/archives/develop/2001-Feb/0391.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_014_nedit.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-061.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/180237","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2667","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/9615a84be27b28681e8a92dcc11ff360547df421/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0556.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0556","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0556.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/2bf475c962629ec6f02e5caa819697d3f035d100/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0556.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-053.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/bd18194e7d4afd6af63b4895317531a574628e62/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-cvjw-q229-564h/GHSA-cvjw-q229-564h.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-053.data","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-042.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0284.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0269","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0269.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0630","title":"MIMAnet viewsrc.cgi 目录遍历漏洞","description":"MIMAnet 的 viewsrc.cgi 2.0 存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向 `loc` 参数传递 `../` 等路径穿越序列，绕过访问限制读取服务器上的任意文件。该漏洞影响运行 MIMAnet source viewer 2.0 的 Web 服务器，攻击者无需身份认证即可利用，可能导致敏感信息泄露（如配置文件、系统文件等）。由于 CGI 脚本未对用户输入的路径参数进行充分过滤，攻击者只需构造特制的 HTTP 请求即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0630"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:39.950","remediation":"立即删除或禁用服务器上的 `viewsrc.cgi` 脚本，该软件已停止维护且不再有安全更新。如仍需源码查看功能，改用现代 Web 服务器（如 Apache/Nginx）内置的目录浏览模块或独立代码查看工具，并对用户输入参数做严格的路径白名单过滤，禁止包含 `../` 等目录遍历字符。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0231.html","http://www.osvdb.org/5565","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2762","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6583","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20878","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0630.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0630","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0630.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0630.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vh7p-m8gj-7qq3/GHSA-vh7p-m8gj-7qq3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0630.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--70b891ca-6f30-4a3a-b496-a2395ed8d3c2.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_iddirtra","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0269.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0268","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0268.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0626","title":"OReilly Software WebSite Professional 路径泄露漏洞","description":"O'Reilly Software WebSite Professional 2.5.4 及更早版本存在路径泄露漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标 Web 服务器发送包含冒号（:）字符的特制 URL 请求，触发服务器返回包含物理路径的错误信息，从而获取网站根目录的绝对路径。该漏洞有助于攻击者进一步探测系统目录结构，为后续攻击（如文件包含、目录遍历）提供信息支撑。攻击条件简单，无需身份认证即可远程利用。目前厂商已停止支持该产品，建议用户迁移至其他受支持的 Web 服务器软件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0626"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:39.500","remediation":"O'Reilly Website Professional 已停止维护，官方不再发布安全更新。建议立即迁移至其他受支持的 Web 服务器软件（如 Apache HTTP Server 或 Nginx）。如无法立即迁移，可在 Web 服务器前端部署反向代理或 WAF，过滤包含冒号字符的畸形 URL 请求，并禁用目录列表功能以降低信息泄露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0236.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2488","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/3839","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20687","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0626.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0626","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0626.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/45906bb48c7a525a11d1008ce22e1e5c2f2f58c2/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0626.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3xc3-m57q-hj7g/GHSA-3xc3-m57q-hj7g.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0626.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Exploit-List-Ja/blob/b82432e7d59d95db9f183c0cefa7744595784afa/2001.tsv","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--798d9e5a-3c3e-491f-bf61-1a7b8c5fc7c2.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0268.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0268.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0268.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0261","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0261.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0614","title":"Pacific Software Carello E-Commerce 1.2.1 命令执行漏洞","description":"Pacific Software Carello 1.2.1 及更早版本的电子商务购物车系统存在命令执行漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造特制的 URL 向目标服务器发送恶意请求，利用该漏洞可获取额外权限并在服务器上执行任意系统命令。攻击条件简单，仅需目标系统运行受影响版本的 Carello 软件且可被网络访问，危害等级高，可能导致服务器完全被控、数据泄露或进一步横向移动。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0614"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:38.190","remediation":"该漏洞影响 Pacific Software Carello E-Commerce 1.2.1 及更早版本，该产品已停止维护，无官方补丁。建议立即从 Web 服务器中删除或禁用 `/scripts/Carello/Carello.dll` 脚本，或通过 IIS 应用程序映射移除 .dll 的脚本映射。如业务必须保留，应在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则，拦截包含 `CARELLOCODE=` 及 `VBEXE=` 参数的 URL 请求，并限制 `cmd.exe` 等系统命令的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98991352402073&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6532","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20850","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2ee9e77ceac534c670c42073c99286dbb69e9733/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0614.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0614","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0614.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c872795777255e25a47f155fd6d323c05ea13ab9/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0614.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-v26x-mmmw-vpcf/GHSA-v26x-m