ohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0395.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2512","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6286","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20714","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/ed228d55b7972f63e700a35a54fbcd94064b9ade/2001/CVE-2001-0593.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0593.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0593","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0593.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0593.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-pfcp-38f2-6hrr/GHSA-pfcp-38f2-6hrr.json","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/A/anacondaclip.nasl","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0593.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--29dcf0cb-9efe-4246-b4a6-f4da0bb635af.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0251.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0249","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0249.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0584","title":"Alt-N MDaemon 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Alt-N MDaemon 3.5.6/5.0.7/6.x 版本的 IMAP 服务存在拒绝服务漏洞，本地用户可通过发送超长的 SELECT 或 EXAMINE 命令导致 IMAP 服务挂起，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞源于 IMAP 服务未正确验证命令参数长度，导致处理超长命令时服务挂起。影响 MDaemon 3.5.6、5.0.7 及 6.x 版本，CVSS 评分 2.1（本地访问、低复杂度、无需认证、部分可用性影响）。攻击者需具备本地账户权限，通过发送超长 IMAP 命令即可触发拒绝服务。ExploitDB (EDB-20696) 及多个 GitHub 仓库均有公开 PoC 验证代码。Alt-N Technologies 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议升级至最新版本。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0584"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:34.850","remediation":"建议立即升级 Alt-N MDaemon 至 6.0.7 或更高版本（官方已修复该 IMAP DoS 漏洞），下载地址：https://www.altn.com/Downloads/MDaemon/。若暂时无法升级，请在防火墙层面限制 IMAP 端口（143/993）仅允许受信任内网 IP 访问，并在本地策略中限制非管理员用户执行 IMAP 命令，同时监控 IMAP 服务进程是否因长 SELECT/EXAMINE 命令挂起，必要时重启 MDaemon IMAP 服务作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-03/0365.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2508","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6279","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20696","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2c72b537371947a8374cf9848353741736f9e49d/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0584.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0584","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0584.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0584.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b6efcebbecad5/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-69xr-m7gp-9vw2/GHSA-69xr-m7gp-9vw2.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0584.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2508/info.html","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151300_151400.json","https://github.com/JakeVincet/nvt/blob/f39b9cba98d614dd2a567b15cce1a5eeb97ad782/pre2008/mdaemon_imap_server_dos2.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0249.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0248","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0248.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0581","title":"Spytech SpyNet Chat Server 6.5 多重连接拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Spytech Spynet Chat Server 6.5 存在拒绝服务漏洞，远程未授权攻击者可向 6387 端口发起大量连接请求，导致服务器资源耗尽崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Spytech Spynet Chat Server 6.5 版本，攻击复杂度低、无需认证、可远程利用，CVSS 评分 5.0（中危），主要影响可用性。攻击者可通过建立大量 TCP 连接耗尽服务器资源导致服务崩溃，ExploitDB 已有公开 PoC（EDB-20828）。官方暂未发布官方补丁，建议限制 6387 端口访问或升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0581"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-08-22T04:00:00.000","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:34.530","remediation":"建议立即停用 SpyNet 6.5 Chat Server 并迁移至现代聊天服务器软件（如 OpenFire、ejabberd 等现代 XMPP 服务器）。若必须继续使用，请在防火墙层面封锁 TCP 6387 端口对外访问，并配置连接数限制（如 iptables -A INPUT -p tcp --dport 6387 -m connlimit --connlimit-above 10 -j DROP）防止大量连接导致服务崩溃。建议尽快替换为受维护的现代通讯服务器软件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-23T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0051.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2701","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6509","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20828","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7a274ec07043f54c07d0a3b5c7fc89ba5793f023/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0581.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0581","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2001-0581.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bae3e1da022eb7a639aee03446096716b0c4798f/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0581.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/daf3a08cbe0139b666db9d48681b